## [0.44.0] - 2026-10-28

### 🚀 Features

- Pretty print top level errors (#553)
- *(log)* Commit trees + local/all branches + all refs
- *(config)* `general.wrap_lines` to cut long lines off instead of wrapping
- *(cli)* Add completion subcommand for shell completion scripts (#555)
- Search via `/`, `n` and `N`, backwards search (vim '?') still bound to help menu by default
- *(log)* Show author and date for each commit
- Port over config from Ratatui
- Remove Ratatui dep. Rendering is now simpler, no double-buffering and diffing.
- Word-wrapping

### 🐛 Bug Fixes

- *(ui)* Clip printed spans to the width the layout gave them
- Copy to clipboard on wayland (enable arboard's "wayland-data-control" feature)
- Calculate display width with unicode-width to handle emoji

### 🔧 Configuration

- *(log)* New general.log_author_width option (default 15)

### ⚡ Performance

- *(screen)* Scroll relative to items instead counting lines from the top
- *(screen)* Lazy compute layout as view is navigated down

